  (text "POWER INPUT 5-32 V DC (nominal 5 V or 28 V) -> single 3.3 V rail (no 5 V rail, no LDO)\nChain: J1 terminal -> F1 PTC 1.1 A/33 V -> Q1 P-FET reverse-polarity protection -> D2 SMBJ33A TVS -> C1 bulk -> U1 AP63203WU-7 (3.3 V, 2 A) -> +3V3\nQ1 (AO3401A): drain=input side, source=load side. R1 pulls gate to GND; D1 (10 V zener, gate-source) keeps |Vgs| below the 12 V limit at 28-32 V input.\nReverse input: Vgs ~ 0 so Q1 stays off. NOTE: AO3401A Vds rating is 30 V - marginal at 32 V reverse (see open issues).\nU1 per Diodes DS41326 Table 2 (AP63203, 3.3 V out): L=3.9 uH, Cin=10 uF (C2), Cout=2x22 uF (C4,C5), Cboot=100 nF (C3, BST-SW). EN tied to VIN (always on). FB tied to +3V3 (fixed-output part).\nLoad budget: ~550 mA on +3V3 (RP2040 + W5500 + DC-DC input), well within 2 A.\nD3/R2: 3.3 V power-good LED."
    (at 20 20 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.5 1.5)) (justify left bottom))
    (uuid "e6c50bf3-890b-45ad-92af-b3d5ffb1b772")
  )
